  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/88/Chick_Voucher.png/revision/latest?cb=20211024200821\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A chick voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"A chick voucher\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/88/Chick_Voucher.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20211024200821\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A chick voucher</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Chick Vouchers</b> are a type of <a href=\"/wiki/currencies-2658\" title=\"Currencies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">currency</a> used to trade for special items in the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a>. They are the rarest <a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">voucher</a>.\n</p><p>Chick vouchers were introduced on November 2021.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Obtaining Chick Vouchers</b></span></h3>\n<p>Players can obtain chick vouchers in a few ways:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Progressing on the <a href=\"/wiki/farm-pass-34637\" title=\"Farm Pass\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm pass</a> road. Generally, you only get 1 chick voucher per season on the free road and obtain 2 additional vouchers if you purchase the paid road.</li>\n<li>Spending holiday currencies (<a href=\"/wiki/holly-35688\" title=\"Holly\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Holly</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-bunny-36132\" title=\"Chocolate Bunny\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Chocolate Bunnies</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/musical-note-36133\" title=\"Musical Note\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Musical Notes</a>) in the holiday <a href=\"/wiki/catalogue-8567\" title=\"Catalogue\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Catalogue</a>.</li>\n<li>Progressing in task events.</li>\n<li>Spending photo reels in the design festival shop.</li>\n<li>Opening holiday calendar boxes on <a href=\"/wiki/greg-7538\" title=\"Greg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Greg's</a> farm</li></ul><p>\nUnlike other vouchers, chick vouchers are not given as rewards for completing <a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">truck</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boat</a> orders.</p><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/44/Chick_Voucher_Farm_Pass.png/revision/latest?cb=20221016213032\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A chick voucher available on the free farm pass road.\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"A chick voucher available on the free farm pass road.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/44/Chick_Voucher_Farm_Pass.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20221016213032\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"268\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A chick voucher available on the free farm pass road.</figcaption></figure>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using Chick Vouchers</b></span></h3>\n<p>Chick vouchers are used to purchase pet birds in the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a>. It takes 9 chick vouchers to purchase each pet bird.\n</p><p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-pets-17088\" title=\"Category:Pets\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Category:Pets</a></i>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6b/Vouchers2.png/revision/latest?cb=20221016213123\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Vouchers2\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6b/Vouchers2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20221016213123\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"213\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<div class=\"note\"><i><b>Note:</b> we have no tips yet for this item. You can help the Hay Day Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"/wiki/chick-voucher-35503\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">adding your own</a>.</i></div>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/currencies-2658\" title=\"Currencies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Currencies</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/chick-voucher-35503\" title=\"Chick Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chick Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"96\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Diamond\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/gift-card-16941\" title=\"Gift Card\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gift Card\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/puzzle-piece-28177\" title=\"Puzzle Piece\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Puzzle Piece\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/token-31466\" title=\"Token\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Token\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-game-features-7440\" title=\"Category:Game Features\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Game Features</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831071252\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 415/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3396/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 820/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.854      1 -total\n 49.13%    6.807      1 Template:Navigation\n 25.70%    3.561      1 Template:CurrenciesMenu\n 18.41%    2.551      1 Template:NavMenu\n 15.14%    2.097      1 Template:NoTips\n 10.46%    1.450      1 Template:Languages\n  9.90%    1.372      7 Template:BigIcon\n  9.81%    1.359      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  8.